output.key_insight:
For real equations of the form x - 1/x = c, a reliable Rocq pattern is:
assert ((x - 1 / x) * x = c * x) by (rewrite H; ring);
unfold Rdiv in the assertion;
assert (x * / x = 1) by exact (Rinv_r x Hx0);
then let nra derive the quadratic. This is more dependable than asking
field_simplify to expose the polynomial automatically.

