output.key_insight:
When applying a recurrence such as Ho : f n = f (n - 2) + 2, first prove the exact nat equality for the
truncated-subtraction predecessor and rewrite backwards: assert (Heq : ((2 * S k + 1) - 2)%nat = (2 * k + 1)%nat);
{ simpl; lia. } then rewrite <- Heq; apply Ho. This bridges the syntactic mismatch that prevents direct apply Ho.
